WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.175
The Wardoll Network.

00:00:02.125 --> 00:00:07.862
An open-source intelligence analysis of the social infrastructure surrounding the accused.

00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:17.325
Accelerationist indicators include Kaczynski references, 'no political solution' rhetoric, and endorsements from paramilitary-adjacent figures.

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:23.362
This network provides context for the institutional corruption documented in the charges.
